WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
00:40.065 --> 00:41.705
The only Wei's Purple Peony in the garden.

4
00:44.225 --> 00:46.145
It alone reigns over all the other peonies.

5
00:47.065 --> 00:50.465
I think only a peony of such peerless beauty

6
00:50.985 --> 00:52.025
is worthy of you, My Lady.

7
00:58.865 --> 01:00.305
What have you put in my hair?

8
01:00.385 --> 01:01.785
Slap yourself!

9
01:12.825 --> 01:14.625
You witless fool.

10
01:14.705 --> 01:15.985
My Lady is to meet Lord Lu,

11
01:16.065 --> 01:18.385
yet you keep going on about being "alone."

12
01:18.465 --> 01:19.585
You deserve those slaps.

13
01:20.305 --> 01:21.425
Don't be angry, My Lady.

14
01:21.505 --> 01:23.825
She's a clumsy speaker who doesn't know any better.

15
01:28.305 --> 01:32.185
How about this twin-lotus hairpin instead?

16
01:32.265 --> 01:33.945
Twin blossoms are an auspicious sign.

17
01:34.625 --> 01:37.145
The design symbolizes "hearts as one".

18
01:37.225 --> 01:40.665
May you and Lord Lu be of one heart and enjoy a lasting marriage.

19
03:29.345 --> 03:33.225
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

20
03:36.825 --> 03:39.945
ELDEST PRINCESS'S RESIDENCE

21
03:49.785 --> 03:51.385
At the Eldest Princess's flower banquet,

22
03:51.465 --> 03:54.545
you are sure to outshine every lady and take first place.

23
03:54.625 --> 03:55.585
WEI RAO OLD MADAM WEI'S FOURTH GRANDDAUGHTER

24
04:00.825 --> 04:02.145
Lord Lu.

25
04:14.705 --> 04:18.025
I hear the Duke's ailment has returned,

26
04:18.105 --> 04:19.705
and none of the capital's finest physicians can cure him.

27
04:19.785 --> 04:20.865
LU ZHUO, HEIR TO THE DUKE OF YING

28
04:20.944 --> 04:23.625
I have some Dragon's Blood Wound-Healing Powder.

29
04:23.705 --> 04:26.745
It's especially effective for chronic sores that refuse to heal.

30
04:27.545 --> 04:30.505
The Duke fought on the battlefield for over 40 years.

31
04:30.585 --> 04:33.305
My grandfather has always admired him greatly.

32
04:34.145 --> 04:35.785
My family offers this medicine with no other intent

33
04:36.505 --> 04:39.145
than to show our respect for the old hero's deeds and virtue

34
04:39.745 --> 04:41.585
and do what little we can.

35
04:41.665 --> 04:44.625
I hope you won't refuse it.

36
04:51.705 --> 04:53.225
Jiede, take it.

37
04:53.305 --> 04:54.185
Yes.

38
04:57.345 --> 04:58.905
Please thank your grandfather for me.

39
04:58.985 --> 05:00.585
When he recovers, I shall come by to

40
05:01.225 --> 05:02.185
express my gratitude.

41
05:10.945 --> 05:14.745
XIE HUALOU, GRANDDAUGHTER OF THE GRAND TUTOR

42
05:14.825 --> 05:18.305
They say Lord Lu is stern and aloof, keeps everyone at a distance,

43
05:18.385 --> 05:20.585
and avoids women in particular.

44
05:20.665 --> 05:22.465
But from what I saw just now,

45
05:22.545 --> 05:24.705
he was quite cordial to you.

46
05:25.225 --> 05:26.105
Don't talk nonsense.

47
05:26.865 --> 05:29.345
Lord Lu is already betrothed.

48
05:30.425 --> 05:31.505
When it comes to family standing,

49
05:31.585 --> 05:33.185
your grandfather is a renowned scholar who has served

50
05:33.265 --> 05:34.465
as Grand Tutor to two emperors.

51
05:34.545 --> 05:36.065
Your family's standing far surpasses that of the Wei family.

52
05:37.265 --> 05:40.505
As for talent, you excel at music, weiqi, calligraphy, and painting,

53
05:40.585 --> 05:42.345
and poetry and verse come effortlessly to you.

54
05:42.945 --> 05:44.665
Yet I've never heard of any talent from that Lady Rao.

55
05:45.545 --> 05:46.785
All she has is a reputation for beauty,

56
05:46.865 --> 05:47.505
BITAO MAID AT EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

57
05:47.585 --> 05:49.985
but she is rarely seen publicly and is always kept hidden away.

58
05:50.065 --> 05:51.585
Who knows whether the beauty is true?

59
05:51.665 --> 05:54.665
And don't get me started on her birth mother.

60
05:54.745 --> 05:55.825
Her conduct and character

61
05:55.905 --> 05:57.465
-are the subject of endless gossip. -Enough.

62
05:58.465 --> 06:00.945
Is it your place to say such things? Let's go.

63
06:08.145 --> 06:12.025
Lady Wei, the other ladies are already waiting in the reception pavilion.

64
06:12.945 --> 06:14.665
I'm feeling a little stifled.

65
06:15.385 --> 06:17.145
I'd like to walk in the garden and clear my head.

66
06:18.865 --> 06:19.785
When I was little,

67
06:19.865 --> 06:21.825
I often came here with Grandmother to visit the Eldest Princess.

68
06:21.905 --> 06:22.945
There's no need to show me the way.

69
06:23.825 --> 06:24.905
Please inform the Eldest Princess

70
06:24.985 --> 06:27.185
that I will arrive before the banquet begins.

71
06:28.065 --> 06:29.025
Yes.

72
06:37.465 --> 06:39.665
Weren't we supposed to enjoy the view at the waterside pavilion?

73
06:39.745 --> 06:41.105
Why was it changed to here?

74
06:41.185 --> 06:43.425
Her Highness said Diecui Pavilion offered a commanding view,

75
06:43.505 --> 06:45.545
and the scenery would be even finer from up high.

76
07:07.105 --> 07:07.945
Seize her.

77
07:11.465 --> 07:12.585
What are you doing?

78
07:22.145 --> 07:24.145
Who's the empty-headed beauty?

79
07:25.505 --> 07:27.305
Whose birth mother is too shameful to mention?

80
07:28.465 --> 07:34.945
And whose conduct and character are the subject of endless gossip?

81
07:35.465 --> 07:39.945
Lady Wei, my maid spoke out of turn and offended you.

82
07:40.025 --> 07:42.625
But she's blunt by nature and meant no harm.

83
07:42.705 --> 07:44.065
What's the rush?

84
07:44.585 --> 07:46.025
I haven't forgotten you.

85
07:47.065 --> 07:48.265
You shameless wretch.

86
07:48.865 --> 07:50.945
What a fine maid you've trained.

87
07:52.425 --> 07:53.945
Lu Zhuo has been betrothed to me since childhood.

88
07:54.585 --> 07:56.545
That makes him mine.

89
07:57.825 --> 07:59.625
How dare you set your sights on him?

90
08:01.625 --> 08:02.585
Shoucheng.

91
08:02.665 --> 08:04.425
QI ZHONGKAI, SECOND SON OF THE MARQUIS OF PINGXI

92
08:07.465 --> 08:09.425
I heard your fiancée is here today too.

93
08:09.505 --> 08:10.905
You're about to leave for war.

94
08:11.425 --> 08:12.945
Aren't you going to say goodbye to her?

95
08:13.745 --> 08:14.985
-Mind your own business. -Come on.

96
08:15.665 --> 08:17.945
Old Madam Wei guards Lady Wei Rao like the apple of her eye

97
08:18.025 --> 08:19.025
and rarely lets her leave the house.

98
08:19.865 --> 08:21.625
Everyone says she's a great beauty.

99
08:22.705 --> 08:23.825
Just how beautiful is she?

100
08:24.905 --> 08:26.585
Put more thought into your training.

101
08:26.665 --> 08:28.225
Something's happened at Diecui Pavilion!

102
08:30.305 --> 08:33.144
I'd sooner see anything that belongs to me

103
08:33.225 --> 08:37.865
ground to dust than share even a fraction of it with anyone else.

104
08:39.985 --> 08:43.024
Xie Hualou, how dare you compete with me?

105
08:43.105 --> 08:44.785
-I didn't… -Do you have what it takes?

106
09:00.385 --> 09:02.465
Lu Zhuo! What's going on?

107
09:03.225 --> 09:04.705
How did she just fall from up there?

108
09:04.785 --> 09:07.065
DIECUI PAVILION

109
09:08.385 --> 09:09.785
My Lady, someone else is here.

110
09:10.385 --> 09:11.545
What are we going to do?

111
09:15.905 --> 09:18.265
Jiede, guard the garden entrance. Let no guests in or out.

112
09:18.945 --> 09:19.785
-Yes. -Qi Zhongkai,

113
09:19.865 --> 09:20.865
please fetch the Eldest Princess yourself.

114
09:21.465 --> 09:22.345
All right.

115
09:24.545 --> 09:26.585
Lord Lu, please…

116
09:26.665 --> 09:27.905
Save me.

117
09:28.545 --> 09:30.905
Please save me. Wei Rao is trying to kill me.

118
09:31.425 --> 09:33.025
DIECUI PAVILION

119
10:00.425 --> 10:01.945
My Lady…

120
10:10.385 --> 10:11.385
Don't make a sound.

121
10:24.105 --> 10:27.185
DIECUI PAVILION

122
10:30.505 --> 10:32.185
Bitao!

123
10:33.105 --> 10:34.585
Bitao!

124
10:38.865 --> 10:40.825
How vicious of you!

125
10:42.585 --> 10:43.705
Pingxiang!

126
10:43.785 --> 10:45.545
-What exactly happened here? -Pingxiang!

127
10:45.625 --> 10:47.305
Why are you two ladies not at the banquet

128
10:47.385 --> 10:49.985
but lingering here at the secluded Diecui Pavilion?

129
10:50.065 --> 10:52.265
And how did Lady Xie fall from up here?

130
10:52.865 --> 10:54.185
Your Highness!

131
10:55.545 --> 10:57.825
I happened to run into Lady Xie in the garden just now.

132
10:58.425 --> 11:00.625
She warmly invited me to walk with her,

133
11:00.705 --> 11:02.465
then complained the sun was too harsh.

134
11:03.145 --> 11:04.745
So she suggested we rest in the pavilion.

135
11:04.825 --> 11:07.945
Out of kindness, I sent my maid back to the carriage for some cooling balm.

136
11:08.545 --> 11:09.465
But then,

137
11:09.545 --> 11:11.185
she suddenly confessed to me that

138
11:12.025 --> 11:13.105
she loves Lord Lu for long

139
11:13.185 --> 11:15.265
and asked me to break off my engagement to him.

140
11:15.945 --> 11:17.185
Embarrassed, I tried to leave,

141
11:17.265 --> 11:19.585
but she was on her knees and begged me

142
11:19.665 --> 11:21.625
to give up the engagement.

143
11:21.705 --> 11:23.585
I tried repeatedly to reason with her,

144
11:24.185 --> 11:25.425
but she turned malicious.

145
11:27.425 --> 11:29.665
Thankfully, my loyal maid Bitao stepped in to protect me,

146
11:29.745 --> 11:32.145
and Lady Xie lost her footing during the struggle.

147
11:33.265 --> 11:34.665
My poor maid.

148
11:34.745 --> 11:36.145
Her face…

149
11:41.545 --> 11:44.625
Wei Rao, you're twisting the truth and making false accusations!

150
11:45.225 --> 11:46.625
You pushed me!

151
11:47.665 --> 11:49.745
Your Highness, Lord Lu,

152
11:49.825 --> 11:52.865
my personal maid Pingxiang can testify for me.

153
11:53.705 --> 11:56.065
Pingxiang!

154
11:56.145 --> 11:57.745
-Pingxiang… -She's unconscious.

155
11:57.825 --> 11:59.345
I'm afraid she can't testify for now.

156
12:09.945 --> 12:10.865
Lady Xie,

157
12:11.665 --> 12:14.585
does this gold hairpin belong to you?

158
12:47.145 --> 12:49.345
If my two maids hadn't been so alert,

159
12:49.425 --> 12:51.185
they came back halfway while feeling off,

160
12:51.265 --> 12:56.265
I fear I might never have seen you again, Lord Lu.

161
12:56.985 --> 12:58.385
To escape blame,

162
12:58.465 --> 13:01.545
you've done nothing but lie and smear my name.

163
13:02.065 --> 13:03.265
Have you no conscience at all?

164
13:08.825 --> 13:10.545
To save my maid just now,

165
13:11.145 --> 13:14.705
I fought to wrest the hairpin away, which is how I got this wound.

166
13:15.305 --> 13:16.865
Please, think carefully.

167
13:16.945 --> 13:18.785
This is the Eldest Princess's residence.

168
13:18.865 --> 13:21.625
I have been strictly taught by my grandmother since childhood.

169
13:21.705 --> 13:23.785
How could I possibly be so vicious and reckless?

170
13:23.865 --> 13:25.625
And where would I find the nerve?

171
13:29.545 --> 13:31.465
I have been wronged for no reason.

172
13:32.145 --> 13:35.705
Your Highness, please see justice done!

173
13:36.785 --> 13:39.825
Your Highness, please clear my name!

174
13:42.065 --> 13:42.985
Lu Zhuo,

175
13:43.065 --> 13:46.545
which one of these two beauties is telling the truth?

176
13:47.145 --> 13:49.705
Lord Lu, what do you think?

177
14:02.145 --> 14:04.065
Only the Xie and Wei families' servants were in the pavilion.

178
14:04.585 --> 14:05.745
No outsider was here to serve as a witness.

179
14:06.625 --> 14:08.385
Both sides now tell different stories,

180
14:09.145 --> 14:10.465
so even Your Highness may find it difficult to judge.

181
14:12.265 --> 14:13.905
Lady Xie has clearly suffered a terrible fright

182
14:13.985 --> 14:15.185
and is in quite a disheveled state.

183
14:15.265 --> 14:16.185
It may invite unwanted gossip.

184
14:17.425 --> 14:18.585
Perhaps she should remain here for now,

185
14:19.385 --> 14:20.625
freshen up, change her clothes,

186
14:21.705 --> 14:22.785
and then be escorted home.

187
14:23.545 --> 14:25.625
Lord Lu, that seems appropriate.

188
14:26.265 --> 14:28.305
Well, escort your fiancée home first.

189
14:34.145 --> 14:35.265
Thank you, Your Highness.

190
14:53.825 --> 14:57.065
ELDEST PRINCESS QINGYUAN'S RESIDENCE

191
15:05.905 --> 15:07.305
Recently, the Hutuo have been raiding our northern border,

192
15:07.905 --> 15:09.745
leaving border families destitute and driven from their homes.

193
15:10.785 --> 15:12.345
I volunteered to lead a campaign against them,

194
15:13.625 --> 15:15.025
and the army will depart soon.

195
15:15.625 --> 15:18.065
When I return, I'll come to your residence in person

196
15:24.745 --> 15:25.745
to call off the marriage,

197
15:29.105 --> 15:30.265
and end our engagement.

198
15:31.185 --> 15:32.425
You want to break off?

199
15:38.105 --> 15:39.945
I've seen countless corpses on the battlefield.

200
15:40.905 --> 15:43.505
The cause of a blade wound can't be twisted by mere words.

201
15:44.625 --> 15:47.585
Whether she attacked you first or you wounded yourself to frame her

202
15:48.745 --> 15:50.465
can be determined by measuring the wound.

203
15:50.545 --> 15:52.345
The wounds are distinctive in depth and shape.

204
15:53.185 --> 15:54.665
The railing she fell from

205
15:55.185 --> 15:57.225
and the way she landed can also provide clues.

206
15:57.825 --> 15:59.185
Ultimately, the culprit

207
16:01.665 --> 16:02.785
will have nowhere to hide.

208
16:05.305 --> 16:06.305
I didn't do it.

209
16:07.425 --> 16:09.505
Why do you trust an outsider over me?

210
16:10.145 --> 16:11.825
Such a beautiful face.

211
16:13.585 --> 16:15.465
Such flawless, delicate hands.

212
16:16.865 --> 16:18.505
Yet the heart inside you

213
16:19.105 --> 16:20.825
is more venomous than any snake or scorpion.

214
16:21.905 --> 16:23.385
I didn't expose you in front of everyone

215
16:23.905 --> 16:25.985
because I wouldn't tarnish your family's reputation

216
16:27.585 --> 16:31.865
or let Uncle Wei's lifelong reputation be ruined by his own daughter.

217
16:42.385 --> 16:43.425
That's right.

218
16:44.705 --> 16:46.425
I pushed her.

219
16:49.025 --> 16:53.265
Too bad fate wasn't on my side and you happened to catch her.

220
16:53.345 --> 16:55.025
Back at Qiyang Pass,

221
16:55.105 --> 16:57.865
my father carried your father out through a mountain of corpses,

222
16:58.505 --> 17:01.025
only to suffer grievous wounds himself and bleed to death.

223
17:02.945 --> 17:04.345
His death left me an orphan,

224
17:04.424 --> 17:06.345
and now you want to break off our engagement?

225
17:09.745 --> 17:11.424
In your dreams.

226
17:13.625 --> 17:15.305
Your family owes me.

227
17:17.305 --> 17:18.985
And so do you.

228
17:19.585 --> 17:21.704
You say I'm as venomous as a snake?

229
17:23.305 --> 17:24.625
How pitiful.

230
17:26.625 --> 17:29.385
You are destined to share a bed with one,

231
17:30.825 --> 17:33.825
and you'll never escape me for as long as you live.

232
17:35.065 --> 17:36.705
Then just wait

233
17:39.025 --> 17:41.345
and see how I end this engagement.

234
17:43.945 --> 17:45.025
Lu Zhuo!

235
17:55.745 --> 17:57.065
-Make way! -Check this out.

236
17:57.145 --> 17:58.505
-Clear the road! -Sir, look at this!

237
17:58.585 --> 17:59.945
Move aside!

238
18:00.025 --> 18:01.145
You there, make way!

239
18:01.225 --> 18:02.785
Trinkets!

240
18:05.545 --> 18:06.785
Then just wait

241
18:07.945 --> 18:10.145
and see how I end this engagement.

242
18:11.185 --> 18:13.065
Come take a look!

243
18:16.105 --> 18:17.345
Make way!

244
18:17.425 --> 18:18.585
It stinks!

245
18:30.265 --> 18:31.705
-My goodness. -It stinks!

246
18:32.745 --> 18:33.825
Are you blind?

247
18:33.905 --> 18:35.705
-Watch where you're going! -I was blind and careless

248
18:35.785 --> 18:36.865
and offended Her Ladyship.

249
18:36.945 --> 18:38.465
I'll clean it up at once.

250
18:38.545 --> 18:39.865
Sir, don't go!

251
18:40.465 --> 18:41.585
What rotten luck.

252
18:41.665 --> 18:43.465
You fouled my lady's carriage.

253
18:43.545 --> 18:45.065
You deserve to be taught a lesson!

254
18:48.225 --> 18:50.865
-You ugly night-soil woman! -It was my fault.

255
18:50.945 --> 18:51.865
Please have mercy.

256
18:51.945 --> 18:54.545
It was my fault. Please have mercy.

257
18:57.585 --> 18:58.425
Please have mercy.

258
18:59.345 --> 19:01.905
-Please have mercy. -Give her 20 lashes. Let's go.

259
19:12.545 --> 19:14.945
A-CHOU

260
20:21.985 --> 20:23.145
That sickly consumptive woman

261
20:23.745 --> 20:25.145
does nothing but bring me bad luck every day!

262
20:25.745 --> 20:27.025
She's made me lose every last coin again!

263
20:28.785 --> 20:30.545
Stop coughing! Hold it in!

264
20:32.105 --> 20:33.105
Get out!

265
20:34.225 --> 20:35.785
You ungrateful little wretch!

266
20:35.865 --> 20:37.745
How dare you raise a hand against your own father?

267
20:37.825 --> 20:39.585
You'll be struck by lightning one day!

268
20:51.865 --> 20:53.585
A-Chou, you're back.

269
21:00.305 --> 21:03.785
Don't mind your father.

270
21:06.025 --> 21:08.985
Once he's had too much to drink, he stops acting human.

271
21:13.745 --> 21:14.865
What happened?

272
21:18.105 --> 21:19.505
What's happened to you?

273
21:19.585 --> 21:20.625
You're covered in wounds.

274
21:20.705 --> 21:21.985
Who did this to you?

275
21:23.145 --> 21:23.985
Ma,

276
21:25.745 --> 21:26.865
I hate this so much.

277
21:29.785 --> 21:32.865
We were born never knowing a full belly or warm clothes.

278
21:34.225 --> 21:36.545
We sleep at midnight and rise before dawn,

279
21:40.465 --> 21:42.985
go door to door collecting swill,

280
21:43.505 --> 21:47.185
scrub chamber pots, and wash clothes until our hands split open.

281
21:48.505 --> 21:50.985
Why should we have to live like this?

282
21:55.185 --> 21:56.385
It's my fault.

283
21:57.545 --> 22:00.465
I brought you into a family trapped in such misery.

284
22:01.985 --> 22:06.105
My good girl, who can refuse the fate they're born into?

285
22:06.185 --> 22:07.825
I refuse!

286
22:09.225 --> 22:12.505
Ma, I'm not some lowly pig or dog.

287
22:12.585 --> 22:14.065
I'm a human being.

288
22:19.585 --> 22:20.905
Just wait and see.

289
22:23.545 --> 22:26.025
I won't spend my whole life as mud beneath people's feet.

290
22:26.105 --> 22:29.065
If Heaven gives me so much as a single vine,

291
22:29.145 --> 22:33.825
I'll cling to it with everything I have and climb upward no matter what it takes.

292
22:35.745 --> 22:37.305
I'll get you treated

293
22:38.785 --> 22:42.025
and make sure my younger siblings never go hungry or live in fear again.

294
22:44.665 --> 22:46.585
I'll live like a real human being.

295
22:55.545 --> 22:56.465
ZHAO

296
22:56.545 --> 22:57.705
The Hutuo have invaded again,

297
22:57.785 --> 22:59.145
but with Lord Lu commanding our forces,

298
22:59.225 --> 23:00.265
we'll surely crush the enemy!

299
23:02.785 --> 23:05.345
Victory! Victory!

300
23:05.425 --> 23:06.665
Victory!

301
23:06.745 --> 23:08.185
Victory!

302
23:08.265 --> 23:09.385
Victory!

303
23:09.465 --> 23:10.625
Victory!

304
23:10.705 --> 23:13.225
Knowing how you feel,

305
23:13.305 --> 23:15.185
the Dowager Lady made an exception and let you see him off.

306
23:15.785 --> 23:17.705
When Lord Lu sees you,

307
23:17.785 --> 23:19.985
he'll surely be overjoyed.

308
23:21.985 --> 23:25.105
TRIUMPH TAVERN

309
23:28.465 --> 23:30.065
Lord Lu will be victorious!

310
23:39.225 --> 23:40.065
What are you looking at?

311
23:41.225 --> 23:43.705
A vile shrew. Pay her no mind.

312
23:46.625 --> 23:52.745
Victory!

313
23:52.825 --> 23:53.905
Outside the Eldest Princess's Residence that day,

314
23:53.985 --> 23:55.345
he could hardly bear to say goodbye.

315
23:56.425 --> 23:58.665
He promised me he'd come to our residence

316
23:58.745 --> 24:00.025
to propose once he returned to the capital.

317
24:01.505 --> 24:03.105
That's wonderful news!

318
24:03.185 --> 24:06.585
The Dowager Lady has been eagerly awaiting this day for so long.

319
24:06.665 --> 24:09.665
I'd better hurry back and tell her,

320
24:09.745 --> 24:12.305
Lady Guo, and Lady Heng'e.

321
24:12.385 --> 24:15.265
We need to start preparing for the wedding.

322
24:15.345 --> 24:16.505
Indeed.

323
24:17.985 --> 24:20.745
I'll wait here in the capital for Lord Lu to return

324
24:21.825 --> 24:23.705
so we can finally be married.

325
24:24.225 --> 24:25.905
HENGCHENG GATE

326
24:32.065 --> 24:33.185
Lu Zhuo,

327
24:33.985 --> 24:35.265
you have no choice.

328
24:39.065 --> 24:41.745
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE, TWO MONTHS LATER

329
24:41.825 --> 24:43.225
WEI RAO'S DOWRY LIST

330
24:43.305 --> 24:44.945
GOLD, LANDS

331
24:45.025 --> 24:46.385
CALLIGRAPHY AND PAINTINGS, SCROLLS, GOLD BRACELETS AND RINGS

332
24:58.505 --> 25:02.185
Massaging this Hegu Point is good for your eyes.

333
25:02.265 --> 25:03.785
I know you're a devoted granddaughter.

334
25:03.865 --> 25:04.505
OLD MADAM WEI, MATRIARCH, EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

335
25:04.585 --> 25:06.585
Whenever my glaucoma flares up,

336
25:06.665 --> 25:08.185
I get terrible headaches,

337
25:09.025 --> 25:12.185
and everything becomes a blur.

338
25:12.705 --> 25:14.345
But over the past month,

339
25:14.425 --> 25:17.625
the pork liver and cangshu congee you've been sending me

340
25:17.705 --> 25:18.345
WEI CHAN OLD MADAM WEI'S THIRD GRANDDAUGHTER

341
25:18.425 --> 25:20.585
has helped a great deal.

342
25:24.705 --> 25:27.505
Mother, these bowls and fruit plates

343
25:27.585 --> 25:30.225
have such distinctive designs.

344
25:30.305 --> 25:31.665
Your recommendation was excellent.

345
25:32.265 --> 25:34.145
Silversmith Zhang's craftsmanship

346
25:34.825 --> 25:36.545
certainly lives up to its reputation.

347
25:36.625 --> 25:38.425
Ever since the girls were born,

348
25:38.505 --> 25:43.865
we've been setting aside clothes, bedding, and dowries for them.

349
25:43.945 --> 25:47.105
Yesterday, I had the treasury opened and drew up the dowry list.

350
25:47.185 --> 25:51.225
I've always had a soft spot for Rao.

351
25:51.305 --> 25:53.425
I simply couldn't bear to see her go,

352
25:54.265 --> 25:57.025
so I took the liberty of adding a few more things.

353
25:57.105 --> 26:01.065
That makes 128 loads of dowry in total.

354
26:01.145 --> 26:03.105
Good. Very good.

355
26:04.705 --> 26:08.585
Heng'e, take a look and see if anything's missing.

356
26:12.105 --> 26:14.345
You're always so thorough, Yufeng.

357
26:14.425 --> 26:17.025
This list couldn't be more complete.

358
26:31.305 --> 26:35.305
Rao, look at what I've prepared for you.

359
26:36.585 --> 26:37.425
Do you like it?

360
26:39.945 --> 26:41.785
What a beautiful necklace!

361
26:41.865 --> 26:44.625
I've been searching for two years and haven't found one of this quality.

362
26:45.625 --> 26:46.985
Aunt Heng'e, why not give it to me?

363
26:48.985 --> 26:50.585
Fine jewels for a beautiful lady.

364
26:52.865 --> 26:55.185
Come. Let me put it on you.

365
26:59.305 --> 27:02.585
They suit you perfectly. Beautiful.

366
27:03.545 --> 27:05.025
Aunt Heng'e, you're so biased.

367
27:05.105 --> 27:08.105
What? Is Rao your only niece,

368
27:08.185 --> 27:10.065
and I'm just someone you found on the street?

369
27:10.625 --> 27:12.905
Chan, mind your manners.

370
27:12.985 --> 27:14.865
How can you compare yourself to Rao?

371
27:14.945 --> 27:16.985
She's had so little love from her parents.

372
27:17.065 --> 27:19.705
Naturally, I tend to favor her a little more.

373
27:19.785 --> 27:21.865
When it's your turn to get married,

374
27:21.945 --> 27:24.305
I'll have something special for you too.

375
27:26.065 --> 27:26.945
Chan.

376
27:28.865 --> 27:30.865
You're her older cousin.

377
27:30.945 --> 27:33.625
Instead of showing your younger cousin some love and consideration,

378
27:33.705 --> 27:36.305
you're getting jealous over a gift.

379
27:36.385 --> 27:40.785
How can you be so petty and show so little sisterly affection?

380
27:40.865 --> 27:43.585
Write out Lessons for Women ten times!

381
27:48.345 --> 27:50.865
I wouldn't dare give away a gift from Aunt Heng'e.

382
27:50.945 --> 27:52.585
I have another fine necklace in my room.

383
27:53.385 --> 27:55.305
I'll have someone send it to you this afternoon.

384
27:55.825 --> 27:57.185
Please don't upset Grandmother.

385
27:58.225 --> 28:00.185
Who needs you pretending to be nice?

386
28:01.305 --> 28:03.545
You're all so biased it's beyond belief!

387
28:04.145 --> 28:05.465
I don't want your necklace!

388
28:06.225 --> 28:07.345
Chan!

389
28:08.425 --> 28:10.265
She's so childish.

390
28:12.025 --> 28:14.345
Rao, don't take it to heart.

391
28:15.345 --> 28:16.785
Pay her no mind.

392
28:16.865 --> 28:18.465
As long as I'm here,

393
28:18.545 --> 28:20.665
I'll see to it that you have a lavish dowry

394
28:20.745 --> 28:24.385
and marry into the Lu family in grand style.

395
28:25.025 --> 28:26.025
Thank you, Grandmother.

396
28:29.345 --> 28:30.465
I'll go find Chan.

397
28:37.505 --> 28:40.065
Rao is certainly the more sensible one.

398
28:41.385 --> 28:43.825
Those two girls quarrel every time they meet.

399
28:44.425 --> 28:46.185
I really don't know what to do with them.

400
28:46.905 --> 28:48.585
They're actually very close.

401
28:48.665 --> 28:50.705
LOTUS ROOM

402
28:50.785 --> 28:53.785
Dowager Lady, the army has returned from its campaign against the Hutuo.

403
28:53.865 --> 28:54.785
Is it?

404
28:54.865 --> 28:57.225
-Did we win or lose? -We won! A great victory!

405
28:59.065 --> 29:00.145
-Wonderful! -Excellent!

406
29:00.225 --> 29:01.505
-Congratulations, Dowager Lady! -What wonderful news!

407
29:01.585 --> 29:02.425
Wonderful!

408
29:03.065 --> 29:04.545
Congratulations, Mother.

409
29:04.625 --> 29:07.385
His Majesty will surely reward Lu Zhuo handsomely.

410
29:07.465 --> 29:08.705
We won the battle,

411
29:08.785 --> 29:11.545
but I've heard people around the capital saying

412
29:11.625 --> 29:14.465
that Lord Lu may not survive.

413
29:15.265 --> 29:16.465
What?

414
29:18.225 --> 29:20.265
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

415
29:20.345 --> 29:21.865
GENTLE AS A SOFT BREEZE

416
29:25.505 --> 29:27.425
Within two weeks of reaching the frontier,

417
29:27.945 --> 29:29.985
Lu Zhuo drove the main Hutuo army back north.

418
29:30.505 --> 29:34.065
That night, he led 3,000 cavalrymen in a raid on the enemy camp.

419
29:34.585 --> 29:37.865
But somehow, the Hutuo had been tipped off and laid a trap in advance.

420
29:37.945 --> 29:39.185
DUKE OF YING

421
29:39.265 --> 29:40.225
We fought desperately to break through,

422
29:40.305 --> 29:43.585
DUCHESS OF YING

423
29:45.225 --> 29:46.745
suffering heavy casualties.

424
30:04.185 --> 30:05.065
Lu Zhuo!

425
30:15.865 --> 30:18.705
Lu Zhuo was struck by a poisoned arrow.

426
30:19.545 --> 30:21.505
Despite his injuries, he charged into the enemy ranks

427
30:22.025 --> 30:24.225
and beheaded the Hutuo's Left Wudu Marquis,

428
30:24.305 --> 30:26.065
Xiahou Xian.

429
30:27.225 --> 30:28.625
Our commander was gravely wounded,

430
30:28.705 --> 30:30.025
but the Hutuo were thrown into disarray.

431
30:30.865 --> 30:32.105
Our troops' morale soared,

432
30:32.185 --> 30:33.665
and we pressed home our advantage.

433
30:33.745 --> 30:35.505
The Hutuo have surrendered and sought imperial recognition,

434
30:36.625 --> 30:38.265
but my dear friend…

435
30:42.025 --> 30:43.345
Quick! The medicine!

436
30:53.385 --> 30:55.705
Physician Zhang, my son…

437
30:55.785 --> 30:56.705
-Madam! -Stay calm.

438
30:56.785 --> 30:57.745
You're Lu Zhuo's mother.

439
30:58.345 --> 30:59.705
Everyone in this household is watching you.

440
31:00.225 --> 31:01.185
You mustn't lose your composure.

441
31:02.185 --> 31:03.025
Physician Zhang,

442
31:03.105 --> 31:07.625
you once served as a military physician and have dealt with the Hutuo for decades.

443
31:07.705 --> 31:09.585
I believe you're the only one who can save Lu Zhuo.

444
31:09.665 --> 31:10.985
HE WANNIANG, WIFE OF THE DUKE OF YING'S ELDEST SON

445
31:11.065 --> 31:13.505
Tell me honestly. Can he still be saved?

446
31:13.585 --> 31:14.905
Your Grace,

447
31:14.985 --> 31:17.665
this is a poison the Hutuo use for hunting.

448
31:18.265 --> 31:19.825
Lord Lu has fought alongside you since he was 12.

449
31:19.905 --> 31:21.785
He should have known how dangerous it was.

450
31:21.865 --> 31:23.665
He should have returned to the capital immediately

451
31:23.745 --> 31:25.945
to have the arrow removed, the infected flesh cut away,

452
31:26.025 --> 31:27.305
and the poisoned blood drained with needles.

453
31:27.385 --> 31:28.705
Then he might have survived.

454
31:28.785 --> 31:30.625
But he returned far too late.

455
31:33.505 --> 31:36.025
I'm afraid his chances of survival are slim.

456
31:52.705 --> 31:55.985
Zhuo can still be saved.

457
31:56.945 --> 31:58.385
I'll pray to the gods

458
31:59.065 --> 32:02.825
and kneel at all 180 temples in the capital.

459
32:03.905 --> 32:08.505
Even if I have to try every remedy there is,

460
32:10.345 --> 32:12.865
I'll find a way to save him!

461
32:19.225 --> 32:20.385
BEARING THE SUN'S RADIANCE

462
32:20.465 --> 32:23.265
Mother was just instructing the servants to prepare gifts

463
32:23.345 --> 32:26.265
so she could visit you at your residence.

464
32:26.345 --> 32:29.225
But unexpectedly, you've come to see us first.

465
32:29.305 --> 32:30.905
You didn't even send word ahead,

466
32:30.985 --> 32:34.145
or we would have arranged a proper welcome.

467
32:36.705 --> 32:38.585
Our families have been close for generations.

468
32:39.185 --> 32:41.545
Once our two children are married,

469
32:42.225 --> 32:43.985
we'll practically be one family.

470
32:44.065 --> 32:46.385
Why bother with such formalities?

471
32:48.105 --> 32:54.105
My dear, I've taken the liberty of coming here today for one reason alone.

472
32:54.185 --> 32:56.985
It's about their marriage.

473
33:14.025 --> 33:16.425
Our families had an understanding

474
33:16.505 --> 33:19.585
that once Lu Zhuo returned victorious, we would hold the wedding.

475
33:19.665 --> 33:21.465
I've already chosen an auspicious date.

476
33:21.545 --> 33:24.345
The 12th day of the fifth month.

477
33:25.145 --> 33:27.265
That's only five days away.

478
33:27.345 --> 33:31.785
Your Grace, isn't that rather rushed?

479
33:31.865 --> 33:32.985
Indeed.

480
33:33.065 --> 33:34.305
For families of our standing,

481
33:34.385 --> 33:40.705
preparing a girl for marriage can take three to five years.

482
33:41.225 --> 33:47.025
My dear, there's no need to pretend you don't understand.

483
33:48.585 --> 33:50.625
Wei Rao can afford to wait,

484
33:51.545 --> 33:53.305
but my grandson cannot.

485
33:53.905 --> 33:57.025
Lu Zhuo was wounded in battle and is now bedridden.

486
33:57.105 --> 34:00.345
The priest from Zhaotai Shrine told me himself

487
34:00.425 --> 34:02.865
that Wei Rao has an auspicious destiny

488
34:02.945 --> 34:04.105
and is blessed with both fortune and wisdom.

489
34:04.185 --> 34:06.985
If she marries him to bring him good fortune,

490
34:07.065 --> 34:09.264
Lu Zhuo will surely pull through.

491
34:10.065 --> 34:13.304
The wedding date was also chosen by the priest himself.

492
34:13.905 --> 34:16.824
Let me make you a promise today.

493
34:16.905 --> 34:18.784
As long as Wei Rao agrees to marry him,

494
34:18.865 --> 34:20.385
whether Lu Zhuo wakes up or not,

495
34:20.465 --> 34:23.425
our family will forever be indebted to her.

496
34:23.505 --> 34:27.185
If my grandson isn't fortunate enough to have such a blessed wife,

497
34:27.264 --> 34:30.385
she may choose any other young man in the Lu family

498
34:30.465 --> 34:31.824
and marry whichever one she wishes.

499
34:32.865 --> 34:34.784
If she insists on leaving the Lu family,

500
34:34.865 --> 34:38.824
I'll give her an additional 10,000 liang for her dowry so she can remarry.

501
34:42.185 --> 34:43.585
I understand now.

502
34:44.744 --> 34:49.385
The Duke of Ying's family has loyally served our nation.

503
34:49.985 --> 34:53.145
Lu Zhuo is a hero wounded in battle.

504
34:53.865 --> 34:57.985
What I'm about to say may offend you,

505
34:58.705 --> 35:00.545
but I have to say it.

506
35:01.065 --> 35:06.065
Lu Zhuo is gravely ill, and no treatment has worked.

507
35:06.145 --> 35:09.065
Everyone in the capital knows it.

508
35:09.145 --> 35:13.905
This granddaughter of mine lost her father as a child.

509
35:13.985 --> 35:20.825
And now you're forcing her to bear the stigma of widowhood so young.

510
35:20.905 --> 35:24.065
You're practically sending her to her death!

511
35:24.145 --> 35:25.705
Mother, please calm down.

512
35:25.785 --> 35:29.345
There are ways to put this more tactfully.

513
35:29.425 --> 35:32.865
We shouldn't damage the bond between our families.

514
35:32.945 --> 35:35.585
I don't care about that now.

515
35:36.665 --> 35:39.185
Your eldest grandson may be precious,

516
35:39.705 --> 35:43.665
but that doesn't make my granddaughter expendable.

517
35:44.425 --> 35:49.145
Back then, I had to bury my own son.

518
35:49.705 --> 35:54.185
And now, you expect my granddaughter to marry Lu Zhuo

519
35:54.265 --> 35:55.785
in hopes of curing him?

520
35:57.065 --> 35:58.865
LOTUS ROOM

521
35:59.865 --> 36:01.745
I simply cannot agree.

522
36:02.345 --> 36:08.385
You lost your son, and that was a terrible tragedy.

523
36:09.385 --> 36:12.705
But three of my four sons died, and the remaining one was left disabled.

524
36:12.785 --> 36:14.425
Who can I turn to with my grief?

525
36:15.625 --> 36:17.985
I blame neither Heaven nor anyone else.

526
36:18.065 --> 36:20.465
Such is the fate of the men in my family.

527
36:21.105 --> 36:25.105
But Lu Zhuo fought for our country and its people.

528
36:25.185 --> 36:27.505
Without his courage on the front lines,

529
36:27.585 --> 36:30.105
would your family enjoy peace and prosperity today?

530
36:32.225 --> 36:34.225
To save my grandson's life,

531
36:34.745 --> 36:36.505
even if I have to use my family's influence,

532
36:36.585 --> 36:39.385
I'll make sure your granddaughter's bridal carriage enters our gates!

533
36:39.905 --> 36:41.705
If there's any retribution,

534
36:41.785 --> 36:43.465
even if I must endure thousands of cuts,

535
36:43.545 --> 36:45.505
I'll bear it alone.

536
36:49.865 --> 36:51.665
As for this marriage,

537
36:52.985 --> 36:58.105
Old Madam Wei, you have no choice but to agree to it.

538
37:00.505 --> 37:01.385
Reporting!

539
37:03.265 --> 37:04.425
An attendant from Changle Palace

540
37:04.505 --> 37:05.465
has arrived with an edict from the Empress Dowager.

541
37:24.825 --> 37:26.385
Open the main gates.

542
37:26.985 --> 37:28.425
Set up the incense table.

543
37:29.025 --> 37:34.065
Follow me to receive the Empress Dowager's edict.

544
37:44.505 --> 37:45.465
Well.

545
37:45.545 --> 37:47.345
Rao, checking out your dowry?

546
37:48.945 --> 37:50.745
Lady Chan, you can't just barge in.

547
37:51.425 --> 37:54.625
-Lady Chan… -Can't I have a word with my cousin?

548
38:00.025 --> 38:01.905
All these jade ornaments and gold bracelets,

549
38:02.625 --> 38:04.265
yet you may never get to wear any of them.

550
38:05.145 --> 38:08.545
Traditionally, a widow mourning her husband

551
38:08.625 --> 38:12.025
must wear the coarsest hemp clothing

552
38:12.625 --> 38:13.705
for three years.

553
38:14.745 --> 38:16.145
Take my advice.

554
38:16.225 --> 38:18.825
Pack plenty of coarse hemp for your wedding,

555
38:18.905 --> 38:21.625
so you won't be caught unprepared.

556
38:21.705 --> 38:22.545
What did you say?

557
38:25.585 --> 38:27.785
Don't tell me you still haven't heard, Rao.

558
38:28.905 --> 38:30.705
Lu Zhuo's injuries are beyond treatment.

559
38:30.785 --> 38:32.105
He's at death's door.

560
38:32.625 --> 38:36.505
Your bridal carriage may have barely entered his residence

561
38:36.585 --> 38:39.505
before you find yourself a widow.

562
38:41.265 --> 38:43.425
You pretend to be so dutiful and proper,

563
38:43.505 --> 38:46.145
but you abuse your maids and commit all sorts of vile acts.

564
38:46.785 --> 38:48.545
Only Grandmother falls for your act.

565
38:50.505 --> 38:52.305
Like mother, like daughter.

566
38:52.385 --> 38:53.385
Just look at you.

567
38:53.465 --> 38:55.585
You were born to bring misfortune to your husband,

568
38:55.665 --> 38:56.665
just like your birth mother.

569
38:57.345 --> 38:59.345
As if brought death upon Second Uncle weren't enough,

570
39:00.225 --> 39:02.745
she shamelessly chased wealth and status.

571
39:03.265 --> 39:05.705
A vulgar woman through and through.

572
39:10.745 --> 39:12.385
I never turned on you before

573
39:13.785 --> 39:15.625
because you were still useful to me.

574
39:17.145 --> 39:19.505
But you crossed me first this time.

575
39:22.505 --> 39:23.665
What are you going to do?

576
39:30.145 --> 39:31.585
Go get Grandmother and Mother!

577
39:31.665 --> 39:33.545
-Show them her true colors! -Yes.

578
39:40.265 --> 39:43.985
She's trying to kill me! Murderer!

579
39:44.065 --> 39:45.305
BEGONIA COURT

580
39:45.385 --> 39:46.585
Mother, don't worry.

581
39:46.665 --> 39:48.465
-Sisters bicker all the time. -Hurry!

582
39:48.545 --> 39:50.425
-Let's hurry. -It's nothing serious.

583
39:57.345 --> 39:58.625
Grandmother!

584
39:58.705 --> 39:59.905
What happened?

585
39:59.985 --> 40:02.225
Grandmother!

586
40:02.305 --> 40:03.945
Wei Rao's gone mad!

587
40:04.025 --> 40:06.905
She's trying to kill your granddaughter!

588
40:06.985 --> 40:08.545
What's gotten into you two?

589
40:10.665 --> 40:12.105
Someone help!

590
40:12.185 --> 40:13.985
-Help! -Help!

591
40:14.985 --> 40:16.145
My Lady…

592
40:17.305 --> 40:19.265
-Someone, please! -Get in here and save her!

593
40:19.345 --> 40:20.745
Get her down!

594
40:23.305 --> 40:24.145
What are you doing?

595
40:24.225 --> 40:26.185
Get her down! Hurry!

596
40:26.265 --> 40:27.585
Lower her! This is terrible!

597
40:27.665 --> 40:29.625
Quick! Get her down!

598
40:29.705 --> 40:30.745
Are you all right?

599
40:32.665 --> 40:35.105
Rao, what were you thinking?

600
40:35.185 --> 40:36.025
You foolish child.

601
40:37.265 --> 40:38.145
What are you waiting for?

602
40:38.225 --> 40:40.665
-Go get some water! Hurry! -Yes.

603
40:40.745 --> 40:41.865
Here, drink slowly.

604
40:42.385 --> 40:43.425
Have some water first.

605
40:46.025 --> 40:47.345
You foolish girl.

606
40:47.425 --> 40:49.425
What on earth has happened to you?

607
40:49.505 --> 40:51.265
You could have told me.

608
40:51.785 --> 40:53.265
I could have sought justice for you,

609
40:54.025 --> 40:56.985
and your grandmother could have helped you!

610
40:57.065 --> 41:00.905
Why would you resort to taking your own life?

611
41:04.985 --> 41:05.825
Ma,

612
41:06.705 --> 41:08.785
I only came to comfort her.

613
41:08.865 --> 41:10.785
But when she heard she had to marry into the Lu family,

614
41:10.865 --> 41:11.905
she suddenly turned on me

615
41:11.985 --> 41:13.465
and started hitting and cursing me like a madwoman.

616
41:13.545 --> 41:15.065
I'm her older cousin!

617
41:16.265 --> 41:17.265
Grandmother!

618
41:21.585 --> 41:22.705
Kneel.

619
41:23.465 --> 41:24.665
Get on your knees!

620
41:25.185 --> 41:26.625
You thoughtless girl.

621
41:26.705 --> 41:29.465
Your grandmother kept it from her to protect the family.

622
41:29.545 --> 41:31.465
How dare you blurt it out and upset her?

623
41:32.465 --> 41:36.185
How utterly reckless and foolish!

624
41:36.905 --> 41:38.825
You've caused so much trouble.

625
41:38.905 --> 41:40.145
Hurry up and apologize.

626
41:41.185 --> 41:43.265
Look what she did to me!

627
41:44.265 --> 41:46.105
She's always putting on an act, pretending to be innocent,

628
41:46.185 --> 41:47.905
and you all fall for it!

629
41:47.985 --> 41:50.785
-Every single time, you take her side! -Enough!

630
41:52.345 --> 41:55.185
Go and kneel in the ancestral hall for three days and nights.

631
41:56.065 --> 41:57.785
No one is to bring her food!

632
41:57.865 --> 41:58.865
Yes.

633
42:04.585 --> 42:05.825
Everyone, leave us!

634
42:15.905 --> 42:18.465
Rao… Rao…

635
42:20.265 --> 42:21.665
Grandmother,

636
42:22.225 --> 42:25.025
I've been ill-fated since childhood,

637
42:26.665 --> 42:29.985
with no parents to love me and no brothers to rely on.

638
42:30.065 --> 42:33.065
I've survived this long only because of you.

639
42:33.145 --> 42:37.265
But Lu Zhuo is already at death's door.

640
42:37.345 --> 42:39.145
If I marry him, I'll end up a widow.

641
42:40.225 --> 42:41.665
People may start saying that the women of the Wei family

642
42:41.745 --> 42:43.145
bring death to their husbands,

643
42:44.025 --> 42:46.465
which will tarnish our family's name and my cousins' reputations.

644
42:47.265 --> 42:50.225
I… I'd be better off dead!

645
42:50.305 --> 42:52.705
Rao! Rao…

646
42:53.905 --> 42:54.945
Rao…

647
42:58.545 --> 42:59.385
Ma,

648
42:59.465 --> 43:03.345
my second brother loved Rao more than anyone when he was alive.

649
43:03.425 --> 43:05.265
She's his only child.

650
43:06.265 --> 43:09.185
What does it matter how noble the Lu family is?

651
43:10.065 --> 43:11.065
If they want to be heroes,

652
43:11.145 --> 43:12.785
let them do it themselves!

653
43:12.865 --> 43:15.225
Why drag innocent Rao into this?

654
43:16.305 --> 43:17.825
Besides,

655
43:17.905 --> 43:21.265
Rao's birth mother already has such a reputation…

656
43:21.345 --> 43:22.945
You be quiet too!

657
43:24.185 --> 43:25.585
Never mention that woman to me again!

658
43:31.145 --> 43:33.505
If I had any other choice,

659
43:35.265 --> 43:39.425
do you think I'd sacrifice Rao?

660
43:41.105 --> 43:44.905
But the Duke's family has outmaneuvered us.

661
43:45.825 --> 43:48.465
They've secured an edict from the Empress Dowager.

662
43:50.225 --> 43:52.705
Do you expect me to openly defy it

663
43:52.785 --> 43:56.025
and send our entire family to the scaffold?

664
43:59.785 --> 44:01.625
An edict from the Empress Dowager?

665
44:06.385 --> 44:09.705
Rao, for the sake of our household

666
44:10.425 --> 44:12.945
and the safety of the entire Wei family,

667
44:15.065 --> 44:20.585
you should forget you ever had me as your grandmother!

668
44:24.305 --> 44:25.145
Ma…

669
44:29.105 --> 44:30.265
Grandmother…

670
44:30.345 --> 44:32.505
Ma, please save Rao!

671
44:33.145 --> 44:35.265
Grandmother!

672
44:35.345 --> 44:36.985
Ma!

673
44:43.305 --> 44:44.625
I can't count on Grandmother anymore.

674
44:46.665 --> 44:50.145
Aunt Heng'e, you've always cared for me the most.

675
44:51.305 --> 44:52.505
Will you help me?

676
44:53.665 --> 44:54.825
How?

677
45:06.705 --> 45:09.625
Aunt Heng'e, I don't want to be a widow.

678
45:19.905 --> 45:20.745
Rao,

679
45:23.985 --> 45:24.865
don't worry.

680
45:24.945 --> 45:27.185
Even if I have to search the entire capital,

681
45:28.385 --> 45:32.785
I'll find someone to marry in your place.

682
47:49.305 --> 47:52.065
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
